      <parameter sboTerm="SBO:0000002" id="f_ugt" name="scaling factor UGT activity" value="1" units="dimensionless" constant="true">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
            <p>Scaling factor of the UGT activity of the liver (and the kidney,
the parameter of the whole-body model replaces both).
1.0: normal activity; &lt;1.0 decreased activity; &gt;1.0 increased activity.</p>
          </body>
        </notes>
      </parameter>
      <parameter sboTerm="SBO:0000002" id="f_oatp" name="scaling factor hepatic uptake (OATP1B1/1B3)" value="1" units="dimensionless" constant="true">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
            <p>Scaling factor of the hepatic uptake of empagliflozin by
OATP1B1 and OATP1B3, the rate determining step of the hepatic
clearance. 1.0: normal activity; &lt;1.0 inhibited (rifampicin,
gemfibrozil).</p>
          </body>
        </notes>
      </parameter>
